# Content-hashed bundle files: a change always arrives under a new name, so they
# can be cached permanently. Workers' _headers does not honour `:placeholder`
# segments the way Pages does, so each submission's assets/ folder is listed
# explicitly.
#
# Models are deliberately NOT cached this way. They sit at stable paths, so a
# long max-age could pair a returning player's stale model with freshly deployed
# code that expects the new one. Revalidation costs one round trip against an
# etag and keeps code and art in step.
/art-of-battle/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
